<QuestionLayout
  title="Does Traverse have a Python SDK?"
  description="No. There is no native Python SDK or pip package that embeds the runtime. Python shells out to traverse-cli capability-package execute."
  canonical="https://traverse-framework.com/questions/does-traverse-have-a-python-sdk.html"
